1
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:21,999
A thousand thanks to Mother Mary and the Holy Son. We are a family living in Melbourne for the past 20 years. My name is Kurian. My wife is Swapna. Our eldest daughter is Nella,

2
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:28,999
second daughter is Bella, and the third one is Ella. This is George. We are here to share a testimony about how our second daughter

3
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:39,999
Bella had a cardiac arrest and then a brain impact, and how, through the intercession of Mother Mary to Holy Son, she was healed.

4
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:47,999
A thousand thanks to Mother Mary and the Holy Son for giving us this opportunity to stand here at this holy altar. On October

5
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:58,999
17, 2023, at around 1 am, my daughter, who was sleeping at night, fell from the bed to the floor. It was a cardiac arrest.

6
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:07,999
We didn’t know what had happened. When we went near her and called her, she was almost in a dead condition. There was only a faint heartbeat. That was the situation.

7
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:15,999
Immediately, we started giving CPR as best as we knew. The child showed no movement. Her lips were turning

8
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:24,999
pale white. Right then, we called the ambulance. The ambulance staff instructed us to continue CPR, but it didn’t help.

9
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:31,999
Then, four ambulances arrived—two emergency ambulances and two intensive care ambulances.

10
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:42,999
All of them together gave CPR to the child for about one and a half hours. In the end, after one and a half hours, they said they didn’t see any major improvement.

11
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:51,999
With only a faint heartbeat, they decided to take her to RCH, one of the biggest children’s hospitals in the Southern Hemisphere.

12
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:02,999
They told me that I should come along to say the last goodbye to my daughter. I said I wouldn’t come, but they insisted that I had to come to say goodbye. I was then about eight…

13
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:11,999
months pregnant. I couldn’t accept this at all because among all of us at home, she was the healthiest child.

14
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:22,999
Even when everyone got a fever, she never got one. When everyone caught chickenpox, she didn’t. For such a child to suddenly have a cardiac arrest and be in that condition—it was impossible to believe.

15
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:34,999
My husband went with the ambulance commander to the hospital. When they reached there, the doctors said that Bella’s chances of survival were very low.

16
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:47,999
They performed open-heart surgery on her and connected her to a machine called ECMO—something we had never even heard of before. Through that, and with the ventilator, her life was being sustained.

17
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:56,999
They said they would keep her like that for 72 hours, and only after that would they know whether she could be saved or not, and in what condition she might be.

18
00:02:57,000 --> 00:03:10,999
The next day, I went to the hospital with my other children to see her. She looked like a lifeless child—her body covered in tubes everywhere.

19
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:21,999
We are a family that prays well, but we had only heard about Kreupasanam. We had never taken any covenant or made any such commitment there.

20
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:28,999
That’s when two priests came to the ICU to administer the Anointing of the Sick (Last Rites).

21
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:40,999
Along with them came a few trustees and leaders from our church. One of them handed me a bag containing the covenant items and papers.

22
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:45,999
I couldn’t even understand what it was at that time because of the situation we were in. I just kept it there

23
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:51,999
in the ICU itself. That bag was given to me by my friend Ramya, who had earlier come here and shared her testimony.

24
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:58,999
Ramya called me the next day and asked, “Have you started using the covenant items? You must use them.”

25
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:07,999
Following Ramya’s instructions, I began to anoint my child’s forehead with the blessed oil and apply the blessed salt—doing all those things.

26
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:20,999
After that, Ramya herself came to see me and told me even more things. She took the rosary from her own neck and put it on mine, even giving me with the covenant medal.

27
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:28,999
We started praying the Apparition Prayer and used the blessed candle and all. However, we didn’t take the covenant yet.

28
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:39,999
We were doubtful—how could we follow all the conditions mentioned in it in our current situation? Could we even go for confession every two weeks? We weren’t sure.

29
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:46,999
Then one day, a large team of doctors called us and said that all of our child’s…

30
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:52,999
They said brain damage had occurred — all the cells were damaged. “You may get your child back,” they said, “but she will have no

31
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:58,999
abilities. She will remain completely disabled. She won’t be able to hear. She won’t respond. She will have to live her whole life supported by tubes.”

32
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:05,999
That was the situation they described. We can’t even fully express here what we went through at that time. I was fully

33
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:13,999
pregnant then, and with our other children to take care of, I truly don’t know how we made it through those days.

34
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:24,999
But one thing I can say is this — when we began using all the covenant items, even though our minds were breaking down completely, we started feeling a strange strength within us.

35
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:34,999
Still, there were moments when, humanly, we would grow weak and lose hope. During that time, the doctors decided to remove Bella from the ECMO machine.

36
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:41,999
After removing her from ECMO, she stayed in the ICU for two more weeks. But still, there was no change — no brain functions at all.

37
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:49,999
Then she was moved to the cardiology ward. It was there that we began to see what brain damage really meant.

38
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:59,999
The child would suddenly slide off the bed, as if falling. She would move like a snake twisting on the floor, lying on the bed and writhing.

39
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:06,999
It was because the muscles in her body — from her head to her toes — would tighten violently every few minutes. The

40
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:14,999
pain was so intense that she would rub her hands, legs, and jaw against the bed, until blood stains appeared all over it.

41
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:21,999
In that state, we continued praying, constantly reciting the Apparition Prayer and pleading with Mother Mary.

42
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:29,999
Even though we hadn’t yet taken the covenant, we prayed, “Mother, please help the doctors find the right combination of medicines for our child. Only then will she find some healing or relief from this terrible pain.”

43
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:36,999
We prayed that somehow, through a divine intervention, the doctors would be able to find the correct mixture of medicines for our

44
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:42,999
child. The doctors who were treating her were among the most experienced — a team of senior consultants, many around 70 years old.

45
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:53,999
They continued monitoring her closely. After two or three days — or rather, after about a week — they finally said they had found the right combination of medicines for Bella.

46
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:59,999
However, even with that, there were no visible improvements. Her life was just being sustained — nothing more.

47
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:06,999
After about one and a half weeks, Kurian said, “There is no hope anywhere. None of the doctors are speaking positively.”

48
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:15,999
So Kurian decided to take the online covenant. I couldn’t do it because I was pregnant and fasting was required, which wasn’t possible for me at that time. So Kurian took the covenant online.

49
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:24,999
Around that same time, another complication arose. The area of her chest that had been operated on became severely infected — pus was oozing out as

50
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:30,999
though her whole body was soaked. One day, even the clothes she was wearing became completely wet and stuck to her body because of the discharge.

51
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:37,999
The doctors came and said there was absolutely no chance for recovery. There were still a few surgeries pending, but

52
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:43,999
they said there was no point in doing them because it would make no difference — Bella was almost gone.

53
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:46,999
They told us there was nothing more that could be done for her.

54
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:53,999
But even as all this was happening, because Kurian had taken the online covenant, we began to feel a new strength

55
00:07:54,000 --> 00:08:02,999
in our hearts — a courage that came only through faith. We started believing firmly that miracles could happen only through prayer.

56
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:07,999
We would sit beside her, constantly listening to the covenant reflections and talks from Kreupasanam, just as Father always says.

57
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:21,999
We began listening to the covenant talks right beside the child’s bed. One day, during the time when the pus infection was at its worst, the doctors took her to the operation theatre to clean out the pus.

58
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:27,999
As I sat there praying the rosary, I suddenly began to smell a beautiful fragrance — it was so strong and sweet. I had my younger daughter, who was three and

59
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:34,999
a half years old, with me at that time. At first, I thought it was just my imagination, maybe a mental feeling because of what Father always says about divine fragrance.

60
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:39,999
But then my little girl asked me, “Mummy, what’s that beautiful smell?”

61
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:49,999
That’s when I realized — this was real. Something miraculous was about to happen. Even if there was no hope, I believed that somehow, our daughter would regain something — maybe even her sight.

62
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:57,999
Her jawbone was broken, saliva constantly flowed from her mouth, and every one and a half minutes, we had to suction it out. Otherwise, her eyes would bulge, and she would go into severe distress.

63
00:08:58,000 --> 00:09:05,999
People who came to see our child would visit once — and never return. The situation was that horrifying. It was unbearable for anyone to stand there and look at her.

64
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:09,999
Her condition was that bad.

65
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:18,999
As time passed, the skin beneath her eyes turned dark, and her face looked completely different. Yet, we continued to pray with unwavering faith.

66
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:29,999
Many people called us to give emotional support, saying, “Don’t lose hope.” It felt as though Mother Mary had arranged a host of angels around us — people who kept calling and praying with us.

67
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:38,999
One sister told me, “Read the Holy Scripture as Father says — not just for half an hour, but for one or two hours. There’s nothing else we can do now.” So we continued praying the rosary faithfully.

68
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:49,999
Another sister called and said, “Dear, sit and read chapters 8 and 9 of the Gospel of St. Matthew — they are full of Jesus’ healings.”

69
00:09:50,000 --> 00:10:07,999
We began reading them continuously — again and again. One day, while listening to Father’s talk, he said, “There is a child whose jaw has completely broken, and Mother Mary is healing that child.”

70
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:14,999
At that exact moment, I felt it was meant for us, because Bella’s jaw was exactly like that — bruised and torn.

71
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:22,999
Around that time, my mother came here to receive the covenant items for us, because I couldn’t travel. She took the covenant and handed all the blessed items to my brother to send them to us.

72
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:31,999
At that time, my mother and I were listening to the same talk. As soon as I heard it, my mother’s call came. She said that Father mentioned something about our child.

73
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:36,999
I asked, “Could it really be about our child? Will such a great healing happen in this condition?” Then my mother

74
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:42,999
said, “We must believe what Father says. Only if we believe will improvements happen.” And we believed and prayed like that.

75
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:52,999
After that, my sister called and said, “There’s nothing else to do now. Try showing Bella some of her old videos.”

76
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:58,999
One side — her entire left side — was completely paralyzed. The right side also was slowly starting to weaken. Her

77
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:04,999
hands were bent like rods, twisted so much that if straightened, they would break. Her fingers were shriveled like dried flowers.

78
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:14,999
It was as if she was dead. But even saying she had died and gone to Jesus would have been easier — this was far worse.

79
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:29,999
Even in that condition, we continued praying with faith, just as my mother said. We used the covenant articles all the time — whenever we washed or touched her body, we applied salt and other things.

80
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:39,999
Only honey couldn’t be given because a tube had been inserted through her nose, so her tongue couldn’t be touched. But for everything else, we prayed and applied the covenant items with faith.

81
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:46,999
During that time, Remya called me. I told her, “I have dedicated the child to Mother Mary’s feast next year, during the

82
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:53,999
Eight-Day Novena. By then, if my child could just see, sit upright, and be taken in a wheelchair, that would be enough for me.”

83
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:56,999
Then Remya told me, “Don’t say that.” She herself had taken the covenant here.

84
00:11:57,000 --> 00:12:06,999
Remmy said, “No, Mother Mary will heal her completely. She will become perfectly fine and come back as a bright, intelligent child.”

85
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:15,999
That’s what she said. Then, while all this was going on, she slowly began to smile. We started seeing a lot of improvement. She told us to pray specifically for December 25.

86
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:26,999
On December 25, even the doctors were astonished — she had become almost completely normal. She even started speaking small words. But they said she still needed tube feeding.

87
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:31,999
They told us that the tube in her nose should be removed and instead inserted through the stomach. We

88
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:36,999
were very frightened and prayed that even that should not be necessary. Her legs were still without any movement —

89
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:47,999
they just hung down helplessly. Still, we thought, even if it’s only in a wheelchair, at least we can take her out. The leg issue and the tube were our only remaining concerns.

90
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:56,999
Then one day, those very same doctors — who had earlier said there was no hope — told us, “Let’s try removing the tube and see if she can swallow a little thick liquid.”

91
00:12:57,000 --> 00:13:02,999
She began to swallow! Then they tried giving her small amounts of fruit puree, and she was able to eat that too.

92
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:09,999
Gradually, they completely removed the tube. After all that, we began taking her outside in a wheelchair.

93
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:18,999
Meanwhile, a lot of medical things were happening in the background — several medical teams were working continuously. But in everything, we remained in prayer —

94
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:25,999
fully believing and faithfully following the apparition prayers and covenant prayers exactly as instructed.

95
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:34,999
Our hospital had two chaplains who regularly brought the Holy Eucharist to our room. When they saw our faith and prayer, they supported us wholeheartedly.

96
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:44,999
Whenever possible, we attended Holy Mass in church; otherwise, we watched it online. Every two weeks, we went to our parish church for confession.

97
00:13:45,000 --> 00:14:01,999
During this time, as I was pregnant. The doctors said that my unborn baby could also have a condition called arrhythmia. So, frequent ECGs and echocardiograms were being done for that baby as well.

98
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:08,999
The only problem was that the hospital where Bella was admitted was quite far from the hospital where I had to go for my own checkups.

99
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:15,999
When she regained consciousness, I wanted to stay close to her at all times. After attending one of my appointments, which lasted about almost whole day,

100
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:27,999
I asked if they could transfer me to a hospital within walking distance of her hospital. They said it was not possible at the moment because delivery was approaching,

101
00:14:28,000 --> 00:14:35,999
and it would be difficult to transfer me. Then my mother, who had taken the covenant here, said, “Your delivery will happen in that hospital itself. Everything will go very smoothly.”

102
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:41,999
At that time, I didn’t have much faith. I thought, “Mother says these things, but nothing like that will happen. She won’t do anything now, right?”

103
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:55,999
One morning, while sitting with her in her room, I suddenly felt labor pains. I was about eight and a half months pregnant when the pain started. At first, I didn’t even realize what was happening.

104
00:14:56,000 --> 00:15:03,999
The pain continued until around nine o’clock. A midwife from the hospital came running and said, “This is labor pain due to

105
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:13,999
pregnancy.” Immediately, an ambulance arrived. They checked my condition and said I couldn’t be taken to the hospital that was farther away,

106
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:23,999
because I would give birth in the ambulance. So they took me to the nearby hospital, and my delivery happened there.

107
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:36,999
The next day, I went to my daughter’s side. She was in the NICU for a day, and then on the second day, my husband and I stayed with her for about 10–15 days at the hospital.

108
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:43,999
We stayed with her continuously. I bathed her myself because the nurses couldn’t do it after my delivery. For two days

109
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:50,999
after my delivery, my husband, our newborn, and I stayed on the floor with her. There were no issues with the bed.

110
00:15:51,000 --> 00:16:06,999
Despite having severe allergies and other complications, I had no problems staying there with her. I had chronic hernia, but even that caused no issues. Mother cared for us and looked after us.

111
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:14,999
Similarly, we wondered if our daughter would be able to attend school and what her intellectual abilities would be. They didn’t know anything about that. But after testing,

112
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:24,999
they discharged her and planned for surgery a month later.

113
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:28,999
Before, it wasn’t possible for your daughter to do anything on her own. The surgeons said she

114
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:34,999
wasn’t capable because her body was too weak, and over the next one or two months they completed the procedures.

115
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:45,999
After that month, meaning a month after discharge, she started going to school. Now she goes to school like any other child, returns home normally,

116
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:54,999
without any problems, taking her medicines in small doses as prescribed by the doctors.

117
00:16:55,000 --> 00:17:04,999
This is a major miracle happening in that hospital. Such recoveries are featured in famous newspapers there, and our daughter’s story also appeared in a famous newspaper.

118
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:15,999
These features were displayed outside her room. That is, my room. Outside my room, no noise was allowed, and the inside was dark with curtains drawn,

119
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:23,999
so that the light wouldn’t disturb her. She was extremely sensitive to light, and even a little light would have caused her severe discomfort. That’s why

120
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:32,999
it was written outside her room. Written outside her room, from there, Mother arranged everything for her life to move forward.

121
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:41,999
They had predicted that within one or two years, she wouldn’t survive, but she returned completely normal to me,

122
00:17:42,000 --> 00:17:50,999
even stronger and smarter than before. She is doing very well. We are immensely thankful to Mother and the Lord.

123
00:17:51,000 --> 00:18:01,999
The first thing I want to say is that I had no idea such merciful acts could happen. We all feel grief for mothers who lose children or for mothers whose children are sick.

124
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:12,999
Such parents go through extreme suffering. This made us realize that whenever we meet such people,

125
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:22,999
we should offer help, emotionally at least, and financially if possible. And wherever needed,

126
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:33,999
we go to those who are struggling the most and share the message of Kreupasanam. I realized this wherever I went.

127
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:42,999
Because of our daughter’s travel restriction, we couldn’t come earlier. Otherwise, I would have come to this sacred altar sooner to give testimony.

128
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:50,999
Now that her travel restriction has been lifted, we were able to come for two weeks.

129
00:18:51,000 --> 00:18:57,999
When we arrived, we first entered from the airport. Then we bought some newspapers here, and at altar of Kreupasanam.

130
00:18:58,000 --> 00:19:06,999
We organized a Thanksgiving party with photos, and also combined it with Son’s baptism, giving newspapers to everyone who came. Since we are still there, we cannot give out newspapers now.

131
00:19:07,000 --> 00:19:17,999
But with my own tongue, I tell everyone I meet about the Kreupasanam. Even now, if I go shopping for a purchase, whoever I meet,

132
00:19:18,000 --> 00:19:26,999
I hold the covenant medal that Ramya placed on my neck that day, and I tell them about it. From now on, I have no other desire;

133
00:19:27,000 --> 00:19:37,999
my only wish is to raise my four children and my family as devotees of Mary. I am immensely thankful to Mother of Kreupasanam and the Lord.

134
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:49,999
For giving such a great physical healing to my daughter, and at the same time, giving immense mental strength to all of us while I was pregnant with Mon in the last trimester,

135
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:59,999
through this prayer of covenant, through faith statements, and through the use of the covenant objects — this courage maintained us in faith. For that, a thousand thanks.

136
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:08,999
Likewise, for being so much late, we offer an apology; as I mentioned, our travel restrictions prevented us from coming sooner.

137
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:21,999
A thousand thanks to Mother of Kreupasanam and the Holy Son. Psalms 116:1 to 8 — the Lord protects the humble. When I collapsed,

138
00:20:22,000 --> 00:20:36,999
He saved me. “O my soul, return to peace; the Lord has blessed you.” He rescued my life from death, my eyes from tears,

139
00:20:37,000 --> 00:20:54,999
my legs from collapse. Brother Kurian George, together with his life partner and children, joyfully testifies at the altar about the great health recovery received through the covenant of Kreupasanam.

140
00:20:55,000 --> 00:21:05,999
This family has been witnessing all this for a long time. Bella, the daughter, this is the proof — Bella areturned from death to life.

141
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:17,999
This family shares at the altar that a sudden loss of consciousness once occurred, which could have led the child to a massive heart attack

142
00:21:18,000 --> 00:21:29,999
and severe brain damage, and afterward, she showed no response at all, and no medicine could be administered,

143
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:42,999
such that the child was moments away from death. This is the testimony the family gives at this altar. They said that CPR was performed continuously for over an hour,

144
00:21:43,000 --> 00:21:56,999
and even after taking her to the hospital and performing an echo, there was no response. Each doctor confirmed repeatedly to the family that nothing could be done.

145
00:21:57,000 --> 00:22:08,999
They could not hand her over to death. This is the realization that kept the family at the hospital every moment.

146
00:22:09,000 --> 00:22:20,999
This is where the importance of the covenant’s apostolic work comes in. The name “Ramya” is repeated three or four times here —

147
00:22:21,000 --> 00:22:33,999
Ramya is the name of the daughter who took the covenant. She enters this family as the presence and protector from the Mother.

148
00:22:34,000 --> 00:22:45,999
This daughter first delivered the message of the Mother to their family, telling them, “Take the online covenant, take the online covenant,” repeatedly insisting.

149
00:22:46,000 --> 00:23:01,999
Yet, the parents had no mental maturity or faith to accept it; they had no hope that the child would survive, so they went through those days with great sorrow.

150
00:23:02,000 --> 00:23:16,999
The priest who came to give the last rites to the child, Ramya again gave a newspaper of Kreupasanam. They did not even glance at it, because the parents did not have the mental presence to receive it.

151
00:23:17,000 --> 00:23:29,999
Again, she gave a newspaper, left a message, called, and said that the Mother would save the child; Ramya would not stop her efforts there.

152
00:23:30,000 --> 00:23:41,999
That is the merit of this testimony. As we, the spectators of the covenant, leave this temple, we have a great responsibility.

153
00:23:42,000 --> 00:23:51,999
For those whose lives are slipping away, we hand them into the arms of the Mother and restore their life — that is the responsibility of the covenant.

154
00:23:52,000 --> 00:24:05,999
We are not taking the covenant merely as petitioners praying for ourselves or our needs. The Mother appeared in this temple to take upon herself all the suffering in the world,

155
00:24:06,000 --> 00:24:21,999
to bear it and give peace and resolution. It is our responsibility, as covenant holders, to bring those suffering to the Mother’s side.

156
00:24:22,000 --> 00:24:30,999
That is why the next day they call Ramya and ask, “Did you take the online covenant? Did you read the newspaper? Did you pray to the Mother?”

